            "testimonial": "<p>”Great design. Most of the water I drink now spends time in the ARK bottle and exposure to the field in close quarters thanks to the awesome design. I carry the bottle with me in the case it came in. I feel like the exposure is helping me get through this challenging time. Thank you ARK team!”</p>",
