    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "How do I know if the quartz crystal is “working”?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Simply “feeling” the crystal’s field and interactions is not an accurate representation of the crystal at work. The technology's effect on water and plant biology has been proven, and the technology maintains a coherent field of interaction from its modulation by our Harmonic Flux Resonator (HFR) technology indefinitely. So, you can rest assured your crystal is working unless it is damaged.</p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I put the crystal in water?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Placing the crystal in water without using proper protective methods can cause oxidation on the magnets in the ARK crystal’s saddle and result in staining the clear quartz. Please do NOT place the crystal in any sort of liquid. </p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "88fe273d-dad8-4fcb-8e72-e298aeffea83": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I adjust the pendant chain length?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Simply pinch the disk that has the ARK logo on it, and slide it along the chain.</p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I remove the crystal from the pendant?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The set arrives with the crystal pre-mounted in the pendant's magnetic docking cavity. Gentle pressure applied to the top of the ARK crystal will dislodge it from the pendant.</p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can my ARK crystal get wet?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>General use is okay - such as getting caught in the rain wearing your crystal.  Simply air dry it, or touch up with a cloth. Please remove your crystal before swimming or showering. Please do not submerge the crystal in any liquid. </p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8fef7e85-3dbd-4573-b556-4afbf969813d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I clean the crystal?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We recommend using a high-grade natural vinegar solution or a jewelry cleaning spray. Use a spray bottle to apply and let everything air dry, touching up with a polishing cloth as needed. Do not submerge in any sort of cleaning solution. </p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab09": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is ARK’s Return Policy?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>ARK offers a full 30-day satisfaction guarantee for which you may return your ARK crystal in its original packaging and original condition for any reason with a full refund.</p><p>Upon inspection of the returned item(s), ARK Crystal will process your refund to the original payment method.</p>",
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
